        "title": "AWD Transfer-Case Oil Leak Can Cause Drivetrain Lockup (Recall 02V-143)",
        "description": "DaimlerChrysler recall B17/NHTSA 02V-143 covers certain 1991-1996 Dodge Stealth all-wheel-drive vehicles built by Mitsubishi. Oil can leak from the transfer case. If the level becomes low, the transfer-case bearings can be damaged and the drivetrain can lock up, increasing crash risk.",
        "solution": "Check the VIN for recall B17/02V-143 and confirm completion. Dealers inspect the transfer case for oil leakage. A unit with no leakage receives fresh transfer-case oil; a leaking unit is resealed or replaced as necessary. Tire matching, performance modifications, or replacing a viscous coupling is not the recall remedy.",
